# k.scenes/shards/things-c: the usual place (sky, ground, water, indoors, on another thing) and the relative size (tiny to huge) of 270 drawable things whose name starts with "c"; labelled by a language model from the names (named=model), a sample checked against the drawings.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: sources/hand-core/place-size.tsv)
